[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Language Spans and Blocks
[/meta]

h1. Language Spans and Blocks

Tests for Section 17 of the specification, and the inline versus block rules in Section 2.

h2. Inline Spans

h3. Span inside a sentence {#lang-span}
[code om]
Here is some [lang ru]текст на русском[/lang] in English.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Here is some <span lang="ru">текст на русском</span> in English.</p>
[/code]

h3. Span at the start of a line is still inline {#lang-span-line-start}
[code om]
[lang fr]Bonjour[/lang] says the sign.
[/code]
[code html]
<p><span lang="fr">Bonjour</span> says the sign.</p>
[/code]

h3. Span with a region subtag {#lang-span-region}
[code om]
She wrote [lang pt-BR]obrigada[/lang] at the end.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>She wrote <span lang="pt-BR">obrigada</span> at the end.</p>
[/code]

h3. Formatting inside a span {#lang-span-formatting}
[code om]
The motto is [lang la]*carpe* diem[/lang].
[/code]
[code html]
<p>The motto is <span lang="la"><strong>carpe</strong> diem</span>.</p>
[/code]

h3. Nested spans {#lang-span-nested}
[code om]
[lang fr]Il a dit [lang de]Guten Tag[/lang] hier.[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<p><span lang="fr">Il a dit <span lang="de">Guten Tag</span> hier.</span></p>
[/code]

h3. Wrong casing is literal {#lang-span-casing}
[code om]
A [Lang fr]mot[/Lang] here.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>A [Lang fr]mot[/Lang] here.</p>
[/code]

h3. Whitespace inside the brackets is literal {#lang-span-whitespace}
[code om]
A [ lang fr]mot[/lang ] here.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>A [ lang fr]mot[/lang ] here.</p>
[/code]

h3. Span not closed on its line is literal {#lang-span-unclosed}
[code om]
Say [lang fr]bonjour twice.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Say [lang fr]bonjour twice.</p>
[/code]

h3. Stray closing tag after text is literal {#lang-span-stray-closing}
[code om]
[lang fr]début
fin[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[lang fr]début<br>
fin[/lang]</p>
[/code]

h3. Span without a language code is an error {#lang-span-without-code}
[code om]
Some [lang]text[/lang] here.
[/code]
[code error]
lang-without-code 1
[/code]

h2. Blocks

h3. Block without a language code is an error {#lang-block-without-code}
[code om]
Intro.

[lang]
Texte.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
lang-without-code 3
[/code]

h3. Block closing tag after text on the same line is an error {#lang-block-closing-mid-line}
[code om]
[lang fr]
Texte.[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 2
[/code]

h3. Block with line breaks {#lang-block}
[code om]
[lang uk]
Це цілий абзац українською мовою.
З кількома рядками.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="uk">
  <p>Це цілий абзац українською мовою.<br>
  З кількома рядками.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block with several paragraphs {#lang-block-paragraphs}
[code om]
[lang de]
Erster Absatz.

Zweiter Absatz.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="de">
  <p>Erster Absatz.</p>
  <p>Zweiter Absatz.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block containing a list {#lang-block-list}
[code om]
[lang fr]
* Pomme
* Poire
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="fr">
  <ul>
    <li>Pomme</li>
    <li>Poire</li>
  </ul>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block containing a heading {#lang-block-heading}
[code om]
[lang fr]
h2. Bonjour

Texte.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="fr">
  <h2 id="bonjour">Bonjour</h2>
  <p>Texte.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block between paragraphs {#lang-block-between}
[code om]
Before.

[lang es]
Hola.
[/lang]

After.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before.</p>
<div lang="es">
  <p>Hola.</p>
</div>
<p>After.</p>
[/code]

h3. Indented block content {#lang-block-indented}
[code om]
[lang it]
    Ciao.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="it">
  <p>Ciao.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block tag after text on the same line is an error {#lang-block-mid-line}
[code om]
Some text [lang uk]
Текст українською.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Unclosed block is an error {#lang-block-unclosed}
[code om]
[lang uk]
Текст українською.
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h2. Profiles

h3. Spans are allowed in the inline profile {#lang-profile-inline-span}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
Say [lang fr]bonjour[/lang] twice.
[/code]
[code html]
Say <span lang="fr">bonjour</span> twice.
[/code]

h3. Blocks are not allowed in the basic profile {#lang-profile-basic-block}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
Intro.

[lang fr]
Bonjour.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 3
[/code]

h3. Blocks are allowed in the standard profile {#lang-profile-standard-block}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
[lang fr]
Bonjour.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="fr">
  <p>Bonjour.</p>
</div>
[/code]
